OL,3,ABaby girl dies while camping with
OL,4,Afamily in woods
OL,5,
OL,6,FA three-month-old girl has died while
OL,7,Fcamping in woodland with her family,
OL,8,Fpolice have confirmed.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to land
OL,11,Foff Strawberry Lane, near Cheslyn Hay,
OL,12,FStaffordshire, at 08:45 BST on
OL,13,FSaturday, to a report of a child in
OL,14,Fcardiac arrest.
OL,16,FAn air ambulance was sent to the scene
OL,17,Fbut the child was pronounced dead by
OL,18,Fparamedics a short time later,
OL,19,FStaffordshire Police said.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
