OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,APeace talks rich in symbolism but
OL,4,Afundamental differences between Russia
OL,5,Aand Ukraine remain
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe talks in Kyiv were rich in
OL,8,Fsymbolism. The sight of Donald Trump's
OL,9,Fenvoys setting foot on Ukrainian soil
OL,10,Ffor the first time since Russia's
OL,11,Ffull-scale invasion.
OL,13,FThe fact they had to travel by train
OL,14,Fbecause they could not risk flying and
OL,15,Frunning the gauntlet of Russian drones
OL,16,F- weapons launched on the orders of the
OL,17,Fman at whose table they sat in the
OL,18,FKremlin only hours ago.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
